contractor supplied or Government Furnished.  If contractor supplied, coordinate 
with the Project Site's NEC (IT group) and include the sites 'standard' server 
redundancy requirements. Note that computer technology changes quickly and these 
requirements should be edited to reflect current products. Default requirements 
(current as of 2012) have been provided in brackets.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
