of 1920 by 1080 pixels and a minimum refresh rate of 70Hz.]<BRK/></TXT>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Keyboard</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>[____][101 key wired USB keyboard having a minimum 64 character standard ASCII character set based on <RID>ANSI INCITS 154</RID>.]<BRK/></TXT>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Mouse</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
