<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Coordinate with the project site to determine if the workstation(s) will 
be contractor supplied or Government Furnished, or a mix where some workstations 
are Gov't furnished and others are contractor supplied: <BRK/>
<BRK/>
"Replace Brackets" instructions<BRK/>
